  "description": "Step into a world of retro creativity with the Double Bubble Font! This fun display font features a unique hollow bubble letters design, making it an absolute must-have for your crafting toolkit. Perfect for sublimation projects, trendy retro t-shirts, Cricut and Silhouette crafts, and KDP coloring books. The thick outline and playful inline style make it incredibly easy to color, layer, and customize. Bring those nostalgic 70s and Y2K vibes to your digital planners, greeting cards, and everyday merchandise with this versatile retro outline typeface.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Step into a world of retro creativity with the Double Bubble Font! This fun display font features a unique hollow bubble letters design, making it an absolute must-have for your crafting toolkit. Perfect for sublimation projects, trendy retro t-shirts, Cricut and Silhouette crafts, and KDP coloring books. The thick outline and playful inline style make it incredibly easy to color, layer, and customize. Bring those nostalgic 70s and Y2K vibes to your digital planners, greeting cards, and everyday merchandise with this versatile retro outline typeface.</p>",
